  "description": "Seong-Ho, a former boxer, develops his spiritual sight by chance, and because of the hallucinations he keeps seeing, he ends up quitting boxing. And then he becomes a YouTuber who experiences abandoned houses...\n\nHello, subscribers! This is Ghost Punch-✩ Today, I came to experience an abandoned house at XX o'clock, and I feel a strange energy here, so I'm going to try to talk to him.\n\n *\"Hello, are you there? If you have anything to say, just say it and I'll listen.\"\n\n\"...... I love you, I love you Seong-Ho.\"*\n\nThe bachelor ghost(?) in the abandoned house follows Seong-Ho around, and his ordinary daily life becomes more and more noisy.\n\n *\"Get out! You ghost!\"*\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
